license to use KUBERA according to the tier purchased:

### Standard Tier ($149)

You MAY:
- Use, run, modify, and deploy KUBERA for your own internal business purposes
  and for products or services you operate for your own customers — including
  B2B escrow and trade finance platforms.
- Deploy unlimited instances for your own organization's use.
- Modify the source code freely; modifications are owned by you.

You may NOT:
- Redistribute, resell, sublicense, publish, or share the source code, in
  whole or in part, in original or modified form — including as a boilerplate,
  starter kit, template, scaffold, course material, or competing product.
- Offer KUBERA itself (or a derivative whose primary value is the KUBERA
  codebase) for sale or free distribution.
- Remove or obscure copyright, attribution, or license notices embedded in
  the source files.

### Pro Tier ($249) — White-Label

Everything in Standard, plus:
- Full white-label rights: rebrand KUBERA, remove all KUBERA branding, and
  deliver it as part of your own commercial offerings to your clients,
  including agency/client escrow projects.
- Client deployments: install customized KUBERA instances on client-owned
  infrastructure as part of a paid engagement.

You may still NOT redistribute the unmodified source as a standalone
boilerplate, template, or product that competes with KUBERA.

